### Library Management API - Circulation Reports & Analytics
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/v1

### Login as Librarian
# @name loginLibrarian
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "librarian@library.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

@librarianToken = {{loginLibrarian.response.body.accessToken}}

### 1. View Overdue Loans Report (Member info, book details, days overdue)
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports/overdue
Authorization: Bearer {{librarianToken}}

### 2. View Most Popular Books Report (Last 30 Days)
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports/popular-books?days=30&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{librarianToken}}
